  triage:title "atm-storage-rusqlite retains dead 'upcoming SQL Server backend' wrapper types/methods contradicting already-accepted readiness-proof conclusion" ;
  triage:description "AI2-QA-1 (ruthless-boundary-qa). crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/lib.rs retains dead 'upcoming SQL Server backend' wrapper types and 7 dead methods, all suppressed via #[allow(dead_code, reason=\"used by upcoming SQL server backend\")], directly contradicting docs/plans/phase-AC/sqlserver-readiness-proof.md:44-51's already-accepted conclusion that no such wrappers remain in atm-storage/atm-storage-claude/atm-storage-rusqlite. Confirmed present unchanged on AI.1 (crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/mailbox_metadata.rs + lib.rs), AI.2, and AI.3 -- origin is the AI.1 baseline, not a new AI.2 regression." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "QA" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
